# build/, sdkconfig, sdkconfig.old, sdkconfig.secrets, managed_components/
# are already ignored repo-wide (see the top-level .gitignore). This adds
# the one thing specific to this project's Makefile: a writable bind-mount
# target for the IDF component manager's root cache, needed because the
# Docker image's IDF_TOOLS_PATH (/opt/esp) is root-owned and the build
# runs as the host user (see Makefile).
.idf_component_cache/
